config:
  theme: redux
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant Stripe
  participant PaySvc as Payment Service
  participant DV as Dataverse
  participant SB as Service Bus
  participant Eng as Evaluation Service
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant Cache as Redis and FusionCache
  Stripe->>PaySvc: invoice.payment_failed after retries or subscription.deleted
  PaySvc->>DV: update Payment Schedule to ended
  DV->>SB: change event via service endpoint
  SB->>Eng: deliver
  Eng->>Eng: re-evaluate, no valid payment schedule
  Eng->>PG: deactivate entitlements, absence means no access
  Eng->>Cache: invalidate